# Cursecloth Wrappings: the embalm its resolved ability gave lasts "until end of turn" whatever becomes of the Wrappings (CR 611.2a,
# 610.3): in Bot1's upkeep the Wrappings gives the Llanowar Elves in Bot1's graveyard embalm, and Bot2 then Shatters the Wrappings.
# In the main phase the Elves still embalm for {G}; the token is a Zombie Elf, a 1/1, since no Wrappings is left to pump it.

